			"notes": "**Bug fixes and some features**\n\n1. Fixed the crash when Spotify isn't open, now the game and mod can launch regardless if Spotify is open.\n2. The mod will start **when u decide to open Spotify**, if you close Spotify, the mod stops working, and when u open again, it kicks back to life again.\n3. Made the mod a bit more memory optimized.\n4. Added mod description and the icon."
